IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}OK!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Io vado a nascondermi!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}
Poi vieni a cercarmi, eh?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ahora que ci pienso,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} se siamo
solo in due non è molto divertente.
{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Cerco qualcuno che giochi con noi!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}To start off,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I'd like you to play
as "it," OK? Good, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh heh. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}I'm excited to see how
you'll do in our little game!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}A party of two doesn't sound bad,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
but it's a bit lonely,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} so I'll call some
other friends to join us, all right?{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Per cominciare,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} io mi nascondo e tu
mi vieni a cercare, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Eh eh eh. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Ci divertiremo da pazzi!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ma se ci fossero altri giocatori,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
sono sicuro che sarebbe ancora
meglio. Vado a cercare qualcuno!{{TAG:0007:0008:58020000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Başlangıçta,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ebe sen ol, tamam
